msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:68
#: 229cd4693b9f49b4bc2aea63dab15976
msgid ""
"The PPM pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM 引脚默认映射到定时器输入，可用于除 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 之外的所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议（这两者需要真正的 "
"UART 连接）。但是，以这种方式连接时，FPort 只能提供 RC 而没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:70
#: 0720dd9d521943c29a2d52985f310ff6
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the SBUS pin can also be configured to be used as true UART1 RX "
"pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL1 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"若要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，SBUS 引脚也可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」来配置为真正的 UART1 RX 引脚，用于双向系统，从而成为"
" SERIAL1 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:72
#: 1915e27f9c854f28b94df75f8c6dab3c
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:74
#: ac21d4b2796c47248bce835acfffd4d1
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:76
#: 9f254db4eb1f4a878519b75205b5be9d
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the PPM pin, but SBUS is not supported without an "
"external inverter."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 PPM 引脚，但 SBUS 不支持外部反相器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:78
#: 2f6559a0ee0a4814ba3a109ee3ac2795
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1 and PPM(R1) via a bi-directional inverter. "
"See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向反相器连接到 T1 和 PPM（R1）。参见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:80
#: d2b79e37c9bd4e5fac234d1030632536
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to PPM (R1), and "
"automatically provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 PPM（R1）外还需要 T1 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:82
#: 7f9ea3c5dd874f75a287b69513ede605
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接 T1 并自动提供数传数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:84
#: 0da377144f3f4b0a9266c63a472592dd
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion)."
" See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容（SBUS 需要外部反相）。详情见 "
":ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:88
#: a06b772f1531476c96531ef49d9ea356
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:90
#: 1e989caf31f048359829ba73eb9ea6db
msgid ""
"The Mamba F405 MK2 has an integrated OSD enabled by "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =` 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr ""
"Mamba F405 MK2 内置 OSD，通过 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` =` 1（MAX7456 驱动）启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:93
#: 2921cab7e3aa465f8003a0eaa638677c
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:95
#: c25b2b312b924d1ca4781bf7709eb174
msgid ""
"The Mamba F405 MK2 supports up to 4 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output "
"ESC1 to ESC4 on the above diagram are for the 4 outputs. All 4 outputs "
"support DShot as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"Mamba F405 MK2 最多支持 4 路 PWM 输出。上图中 ESC1~ESC4 电机输出焊盘对应 4 路输出，全部支持 DShot 及所有 "
"PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:97
#: b04d3c22f60b421189935f744cdbafa9
msgid "The outputs are all in one group."
msgstr "所有输出在同一组。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:99
#: 03d3dc782152407ab9ae0c16ce947054
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:104
#: 0ce2cf0326fc48efbb40b3390c337e5a
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:106
#: 2e25318fd03841089dfc92059ff02bae
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor. The voltage sensor can handle up to"
" 6S LiPo batteries. An external current sense input is also provided."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，最高支持 6S 锂电池。同时提供外部电流传感器输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:109
#: 5df74ff423364fc9948caf36de05dc92
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:111
#: d006bd8b5e514b20a0c022a56f9193bd
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 3 for voltage only or = 4 if external "
"current sense is also used."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 3（仅电压）或 = 4（同时使用外部电流传感器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:112
#: a0866a82a73d48178d3e8ec87073baa2
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:113
#: cda0908af6b44b8e954982232dffe6fb
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:114
#: 4d1029b204eb4f70a74ada97f245849a
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:115
#: 045d6a850e524926b01cd15591bdfdd7
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` depends on "
"external current sensor used"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 取决于所用外部电流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:118
#: 15ab05676e7141f2b04be5e879bc5627
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:120
#: c8b9024e0b7849559b3734c3a0ff07ae
msgid ""
"The Mamba Basic autopilots do not have a builting compass, but you can "
"attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads or refer to "
":ref:`common-compassless`."
msgstr ""
"Mamba Basic 飞控没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘，或参考 :ref:`common-"
"compassless`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:123
#: 0dbf6deabf684536b7d40e9dd20c7747
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:125
#: 96f04a06b2e64d7a9afc3201625746b0
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"MambaF405US-I2C\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"找到，位于标有「MambaF405US-I2C」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:127
#: 7e3a1aeff9e94a96a9ee046d015e6ee4
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware. See :ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：在按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB，然后加载「with_bl.hex」固件。参见 :ref:`common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba-basic-mk3.rst:131
#: c9463306901747b4ac48b0517cc840dc
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \".apj\" "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用「.apj」固件文件。"
